000</span><span style=\"text-indent: -30pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -30pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">/1</span><span style=\"text-indent: -30pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">시간</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14.6667px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;o&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -87pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">주요업무</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -87pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><b style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 9pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -87pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">설계 및 해석 교육 참여와&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -87pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">MNS Engineering</span><span style=\"text-indent: -87pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">의 기업 애로기술</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -87pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -87pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">해소에 참여</span></b></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - IDEA&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">및&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">Concept design</span><span style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">의&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2D. 3D</span><span style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">데이터 획득</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(S/W: AutoCAD, Autodesk Inventor)</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14.6667px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -</span><span style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14.6667px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">제품&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2D</span><span style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">도면의&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">3D</span><span style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">모델링을 통한 설계 검증</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(S/W: Autodesk Inventor)</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14.6667px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -</span><span style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14.6667px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">설계 데이터에 대한 신뢰성</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">안정성 검증을 위한 해석</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(S/W: ANSYS)</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 19.2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; text-indent: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 21.3333px; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">4.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">기타</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14.6667px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;o&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">학생 인턴은 서류 또는 면접을 통해 선발예정</span></span><br></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14.6667px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;o&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">학생 인턴은 학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">제한은 없으나 설계 및 해석 관련 소프트웨어 사용 경험이나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">관련 업무에 대한 이해도가&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;높은 학생을 선발 예정</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14.6667px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;o&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">근무시간은 오전&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">9</span><span style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">시&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">~ 18</span><span style=\"text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">시 내에서 근무가능한 시간을 정해서 근무</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;o&nbsp;</span>2024</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">년&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">5</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">, 6</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">월은 주&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">시간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">달&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">40</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">시간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">, 7</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">, 8</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">월은 주&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">20</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">시간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">달&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">80</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">시간</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14.6667px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;o&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">학생은 근무시간 및 근무내용을 일지 작성 후 담당자에게 제출할 의무가 있음<br></span></p><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><br></span></font></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>※&nbsp; 문의 및 지원서 제출</b></span></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">국립금오공과대학교 산학협력단(MNS Engineering)</span></b></span></font></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbs